      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-2026-06-23T06:14:25.932650+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-06-23T06:14:25.932650+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-hf.co/s3nh/Unbabel-TowerInstruct-7B-v0.1-GGUF_Q4_K_M_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "The longer answer is that educational technology spent those years solving the wrong problem. EdTech iterated on the classroom — better LMS, better video, better quiz tools. It made the existing model more efficient. Peripateticware doesn't try to make the classroom more efficient. It tries to replace the classroom, at least occasionally, with the world."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "الجواب الطويل هو أن التكنولوجيا التعليمية تمثل هذه السنوات في حل مشاكل غير صالح. تعدّلت التكنولوجيا التعليمية مجال التدريب في السكن — خدمات LMS أفضل، فيديو أفضل، إدارة استباق أفضل. تم تحديث المجال ال existent لتطبيقه بشكل أفضل. وعندما يتم تحديث الخاصة، تسعى التكنولوجيا التعليمية إلى إزالة المركز التعليمي بعدًا أو فقط بعضًا، بالعالم. \"\n\"The longer answer is that educational technology spent those years solving the wrong problem. EdTech iterated on the classroom — better LMS, better video, better quiz tools. It made the existing model more efficient. Peripateticware doesn't try to make the classroom more efficient. It tries to replace the classroom, at least occasionally, with the world.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te-2026-06-23T06:14:25.932650+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.the_longer_answer_is_that_educational_te"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-06-23T06:24:52.199999+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-06-23T06:24:52.199999+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-hf.co/s3nh/Unbabel-TowerInstruct-7B-v0.1-GGUF_Q4_K_M_Profile__Technical/Legal_Documentation_|_Temp__0.1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That's a harder sell. Schools are risk-averse. Outdoor learning has a liability optic. \"The world is your classroom\" sounds like a marketing line until you've watched a ten-year-old explain sediment transport to a crow-shaped AI guide while standing in a creek bed, and then read the field journal entry they wrote that afternoon, and understood that they understood."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "هذا المجرد تبيع. أهلاً وسهلاً، فإن مدارسهم قد كانوا خاصة بالخطر. تعلم الأطلال يزعج أمنها. \\\"العالم هو مكتبك\\\" يصدر كحدث تسوق حتى ترد في خيار تعليم الطفل عشر أعمال تنظيم تنقيد في حي العصير، وثقافة جميع معلوماته بالخلفية، وكان أنت يفهم الآن أنك تفهم.، \\\"حساب شرطي",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver-2026-06-23T06:24:52.199999+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-pages_originstorypage.thats_a_harder_sell_schools_are_riskaver"
      }
    },
